  "idea": "Beginner guide to setting up your first free Notion workspace in 5 minutes",
  "text": "How beginners should actually set up Notion without getting overwhelmed. Watching advanced YouTube tutorials makes you believe you need automated formulas just to track a daily to-do list. Frustration peaks when broken database relations prevent you from finding yesterday\u2019s important meeting notes. Keep it simple by creating a single Notion document with bullet lists for goals and checkboxes for actions. You maintain full control over your schedule without technical headaches.",
